  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - Water and Wastewater Management, through Green Power Systems, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $80,000 Definitional Mission (DM) identifies and evaluates opportunities in the water and wastewater management sector in Indonesia and Vietnam for USTDA funding consideration. The rapid urbanization in the southern region of Vietnam in recent years has exacerbated the existing water and wastewater infrastructure, while Indonesia has among the lowest standards for water quality supply and treatment in the region. The DM contractor will travel for at least three weeks to the countries and identify at least six (6) activities for USTDA funding consideration.</narrative>
  </description>
